[
  {
    "id": 1004001030010,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ここが明日のステージかぁ～。いいねいいね！\r\nこのステージでみんなとパフォーマンス～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00012",
    "bgm": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、明日はユニットでの出演だけど\r\n恋鐘にはソロがあるからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ソロでの立ち位置や、\r\n準備なんかのために下見は重要だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うん！　なんか会場の下見ってアイドルっぽくて\r\nばり楽しいばい～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おいおい、アイドルっぽいじゃなくて\r\n恋鐘は正真正銘アイドルだろ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えへへ、なんか改めてアイドルっち言われると\r\nやっぱ、うれしかね～……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よーし、明日はうちがみんなを引っ張っていくけん！\r\n見とってね～！　プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、応援してるぞ。恋鐘",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（しかしこの前のステージでも話に夢中でMC中に\r\n転びそうになってたし……まだ危なっかしいんだよな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（今回のステージではやる気が空回りしないよう\r\nしっかり見といてやらないと……）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おーい！　プロデューサー？\r\nずっと、そがいなとこにつっ立ってどうしたと～？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　ああいや、なんでもないよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "そう？　じゃあこの後は何すると～？\r\n帰ってレッスン？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな、せっかくだし控室で\r\n明日のステージをどうやって進めるか計画を立てようか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "おお！　さすがプロデューサー！\r\nそれは名案やね～",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "off",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00009",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffect": "mask"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "で、恋鐘は明日のステージでやりたいことは何かあるか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "004",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ある！　いっぱいあるよ～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "まず、お客さんをステージに呼んで一緒に踊るばい～！\r\nこれはばーり楽しかよ～！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお、ファン参加型か面白いかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それからお客さんのリクエストば聞いて即興で歌う～！\r\n他のユニットの歌とかね！　いい曲多いけんね～！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "確かに、うちの他のアイドルユニットにも\r\n興味を持ってもらえるかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あとじゃんけん大会～！\r\n優勝者には、うちがばりそっくりの似顔絵を描くばい！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おお……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あとあと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょっと待て、恋鐘",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "なんね～、プロデューサー？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それ全部やってたら恋鐘のソロパートどころか\r\nライブの時間全部使い切っちゃうぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "あ……そっか、うちだけのライブやないもんね～",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030150,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "けど、どれもみんなばり喜んでくれると思うし……\r\nうーん、どれがよかかなんて選べんばい～！",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030160,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "やっぱり、やる気で早回しして全部……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_doya",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、待て待て、ひとつに集中した方が\r\n絶対いいステージになると思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030170,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "んー……そう？\r\nじゃあ、なんすれば一番よかかね～……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030170"
  },
  {
    "select": "歌に集中しよう",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "ダンスに気合をいれよう",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "笑顔を見せよう",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "歌に集中しよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "アイドルと言えばやっぱり歌だ\r\nお客さんもきっと喜ぶ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "確かに！　うちも子供のころアイドルの歌ば聴いて\r\nよくはしゃいどったばい～！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1004001030190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "よーし、じゃあ明日は歌一本に絞るばい～！\r\nそれで、ファンの心をがっちり掴んでみせるけんね！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100400103/1004001030190"
  },
  {
